                <Param name="text" val="Task instructions:&#10;Focus on the + mark while the trial starts. A cue will appear.&#10;WAIT UNTIL THE DOT APPEARS.&#10;&#10;Press the LEFT arrow key if the target dot appears on the left.&#10;Press the RIGHT arrow key if the target dot appears on the right.&#10;&#10;Respond as quickly and accurately as you can.&#10;&#10;Press any key to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" plugin="None"/>
